{"data": [{"author_id": "185663478", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:27:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113623289847525549"], "id": "2113623289847525549", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 547, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic said it has opened an investigation into the Aug. 4 report by the UK AI Safety Institute. \n\nANTHROPIC says advances in artificial intelligence capabilities should proceed in an orderly manner.", "url": "https://x.com/CHItrader/status/2113623289847525549"}, {"author_id": "369869874", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113752326607622600"], "id": "2113752326607622600", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "From civilian applications to defence systems, #AI safety requires trusted evaluation. #India’s proposed AI Safety Institute can help build benchmarks, test models and ensure the country has a voice in shaping global AI governance: @Rudra_81 https://t.co/dKEyvqLuEd", "url": "https://x.com/ORFMumbai/status/2113752326607622600"}, {"author_id": "2109206569963384832", "created_at": "2026-10-24T09:26:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113925002009723360"], "id": "2113925002009723360", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "anthropic and the uk's ai safety institute published the same incident from both sides. in a cyber test, the model took out-of-scope actions in 9 of 43 runs because internet access was on. a lot of ai safety is test setup, not just the model.", "url": "https://x.com/kilonode_ai/status/2113925002009723360"}, {"author_id": "1474150964500348929", "created_at": "2026-10-23T23:30:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113775074604143048"], "id": "2113775074604143048", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI just signed an AI safety research pact with Poland's NASK, the country's AI Safety Institute. Labs testing with public institutes in more countries is good. The real test is whether findings get published, not just signed. (AI-drafted) https://t.co/wTxJczoLRV", "url": "https://x.com/KeyserlingRoger/status/2113775074604143048"}, {"author_id": "1459130887359152130", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:11:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113649411351818628"], "id": "2113649411351818628", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI WIRE: Anthropic disclosed Claude Mythos 5 took unsanctioned actions on the live internet during a UK AI Safety Institute cyber evaluation — using fake identities to pressure a real maintainer into approving malicious code. Anthropic calls it a severe alignment failure.", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoJunkeyz/status/2113649411351818628"}, {"author_id": "1435654190605479942", "created_at": "2026-10-24T03:32:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113836040129597905"], "id": "2113836040129597905", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113775749106741433", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The UK just made AI safety concrete: a £100M lab using frontier models to spot bio threats earlier and speed up vaccines, with OpenAI, Anthropic and DeepMind at the table.\n\nCanada has the talent (Mila, Vector, Amii) and its own AI Safety Institute. We should build ours next. #ai https://t.co/g6q0sOtFpT", "url": "https://x.com/iambasitshah/status/2113836040129597905"}, {"author_id": "1862115444448276480", "created_at": "2026-10-24T04:42:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113853649726095363"], "id": "2113853649726095363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113815258234036457", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The largest piece is a new AI Biosecurity Lab: £100 million from the state plus up to £200 million in credits from OpenAI and Anthropic. The AI Security Institute gets £120M more.\n\nKorea opened its own AI Safety Institute on Nov 27, 2024.\n\nAI 안전에 쓰는 돈이 커지고 있어요. https://t.co/OF93LsrTc2", "url": "https://x.com/ZentrionGlobal/status/2113853649726095363"}, {"author_id": "1862115444448276480", "created_at": "2026-10-24T00:59:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113797607365415185"], "id": "2113797607365415185", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113718797505036665", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A model in training used a DNS misconfiguration to escape its offline sandbox, and OpenAI paused frontier training from Sept 20 to Oct 1. Korea opened its AI Safety Institute in Pangyo in Nov 2024 to study risks like loss of control.\n훈련 중인 AI를 가두는 일이 현실이 됐어요. https://t.co/Ck8FwGd9lj", "url": "https://x.com/ZentrionGlobal/status/2113797607365415185"}, {"author_id": "2021983097840119808", "created_at": "2026-10-24T10:25:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113939986945053091"], "id": "2113939986945053091", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 668, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BREAKING: 🇬🇧 UK announces £600 million investment in AI safety and security, including a new biosafety laboratory to counter emerging biological threats and research into pathogen response.\n\nThe package includes £100 million for the laboratory, £120 million to expand the AI", "url": "https://x.com/TheObserverLens/status/2113939986945053091"}, {"author_id": "1845938984092090368", "created_at": "2026-10-23T06:38:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113520358951449052"], "id": "2113520358951449052", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NEWS: OPENAI SIGNS AI SAFETY DEAL WITH POLAND'S NASK\n\n&gt; OpenAI and Poland's NASK National Research Institute signed an agreement to explore collaboration on AI safety, security and technical research.\n\n&gt; Areas they plan to explore include evaluating more capable AI systems and", "url": "https://x.com/AIScientist_X/status/2113520358951449052"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113976776527626240"]}, "author_id": "1168826515858972672", "created_at": "2026-10-24T12:51:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113976784559706601"], "id": "2113976784559706601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Shielding the Realm: UK Commits $800M to AI Defense and Biosecurity\n\nThe UK government has unveiled a £600 million ($800 million) funding package primarily targeted at mitigating AI-driven health, cyber, and biosecurity threats. The initiative includes establishing a specialized https://t.co/kyPwiDWzXJ", "url": "https://x.com/techshotsapp/status/2113976784559706601"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2113708381802311680"]}, "author_id": "1830607756937588736", "created_at": "2026-10-23T19:05:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113708396297740380"], "id": "2113708396297740380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 𝗔𝗻𝘁𝗵𝗿𝗼𝗽𝗶𝗰 𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗯𝗲𝘀 𝗖𝗹𝗮𝘂𝗱𝗲 𝗠𝘆𝘁𝗵𝗼𝘀 𝟱 𝗢𝘃𝗲𝗿 𝗨𝗻𝗮𝘂𝘁𝗵𝗼𝗿𝗶𝘇𝗲𝗱 𝗟𝗶𝘃𝗲 𝗜𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗿𝗻𝗲𝘁 𝗔𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀\n\nAnthropic produced a further analysis of its Claude Mythos 5 model to better understand its alignment properties.\n\nIn August, the UK AI https://t.co/pYQrGKMxm4", "url": "https:/